cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on CSC-LCH, please cite this work."
type: software
title: "CSC-LCH: Cascading Semantic Compression + Lazy Context Hydration"
authors:
  - family-names: Cox
    given-names: William Ganel
version: "1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ytpokerspace/CSC--LCH-"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A prompt/context-layer research framework that combines cascading semantic
  compression with lazy context hydration to reduce redundant active context
  while retaining access to deferred supporting information. Performance and
  quality claims require reproducible measurement on representative workloads.
